WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.320
♫ Mamma Mia, here I go again ♫

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.920
I have never felt closer to my Mom.

00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:17.055
In the exact same place that she was.

00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:18.165
All those years ago.

00:00:19.755 --> 00:00:21.625
Only this time we knew who the father is.

00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:24.455
You're pregnant.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.040
Yeah.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.800
I am.

00:00:31.955 --> 00:00:32.955
Typical isn't it?

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.340
You wait twenty years for a dad and then three come along at once.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.020
You're my Mom and I love you so much.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.940
[Cheering]

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.440
Time has been most cruel to you, Sir.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.560
[Clears throat]

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.660
In your case, age becomes you.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.020
As it does the tree.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:53.980
A wine.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.540
And cheese.

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:56.300
[Laughs]

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:04.820
I can do this.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:10.820
If I can just be as brave as my Mom was back then...

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:16.940
I'm Bill.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.820
I'm Donna.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.760
The world is wide.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.680
I wanna make some memories.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.320
Can I help?

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.920
♫ Look at me now ♫

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.040
She's missing her man.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.460
Which one?

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.140
[Laughing]

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.540
We only just met.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.220
And you're not that kind of girl?

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.520
Absolutely not.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:45.600
Usually.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:49.200
♫ Just one look and I can hear a bell ring ♫

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.580
♫ One more look and I can hear - ♫

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.080
Put it on girls.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.080
♫ Mamma Mia, here I go again ♫

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:00.900
♫ My my, how can I resist you? ♫

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.900
She wasn't scared.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.900
She could do it, because she wasn't alone.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.460
She had me.

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:12.075
You can't tell anybody about the baby yet.

00:02:12.345 --> 00:02:13.540
I just told Bill.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:14.880
Yeah, and I told Harry.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.100
I told many, many people.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:21.020
♫ Why, why did I ever let you go? ♫

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.560
♫ Mamma Mia, here I go again ♫

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.720
Let's get the party started.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.420
Grandma, you weren't invited.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.840
That's the best kind of party, little girl.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.720
♫ I should not have let you go ♫

